# Allow-list build context for the group-continuity-across-blocks harness image: everything is
# excluded, then only the files the build stage copies are let back in (the
# files of spikes/02, 07, 08 and 10 read only).
*
!global.json
!Directory.Build.props
!NuGet.config
!.editorconfig
!spikes/Directory.Build.props
!spikes/13-group-continuity-across-blocks/Directory.Packages.props
!spikes/13-group-continuity-across-blocks/CrossBlockLayoutSpike/**
